adopted the Annual General Adjustment (AGA) Order for Year 2026 which will allow
eligible landlords to increase the 2025 permanent rent ceilings by 1.0% no earlier than
January 1, 2026","interaction":"State Costa-Hawkins Rental Housing Act bars the 2026 AGA from adjusting rents of tenancies that began on or after January 1, 2025.","relations":[],"confidence":0.85,"conflict_flag":false,"conflict_note":null}
